# NFS 4.1 exports of the repo pod (docs/proposals/session-workspaces.md, 5.2).
# Paths are relative to the nfs container's NFS_ROOT. The fixed fsid keeps
# file handles valid after a restart. root_squash maps a client's root to
# nobody, so nothing owned by root here (mirrors, sandbox remotes, markers)
# can be changed over NFS.
/ws/a       *(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash,fsid=1)
/ws/shared  *(rw,sync,no_subtree_check,root_squash,fsid=2)
